        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana BTC10, Small Ball Tension Catch</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nSmall Lighter Duty ball tension catches are mostly used on cabinet doors when a high end appearance is required or for heavier duty application than a magnet catch. May also be used on furniture, cabinet doors, closets or other lightweight doors. It has an easily adjustable tension. Comes packaged with matching finish mounting screws. Made of solid brass they are available in 9 different finishes.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<table width=\"300\" align=\"right\">\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/deltana-BTC10-size.gif?v=1704354566\" width=\"300\" height=\"150\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana BTC10  Ball Tension Catch\">\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nOther size ball tension catches:\r\n<br>\r\n<a href=\"/products/solid-brass-medium-ball-tension-catch-deltana-btc20\"><b>Medium Ball Tension Catch</b></a> - \r\n<a href=\"/products/solid-brass-large-ball-tension-catch-deltana-btc30\"><b>Large Ball Tension Catch</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>\r\nSpecifications</b> for the Deltana BTC10 Small Ball Tension Catch:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Base Max Length: 1-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Base Width: 5/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Height: 5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Adjustable Tension</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/BTC10.pdf?v=1691095270\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana BTC10 Dimension Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNo matter which finish you choose for the outside, it will still be solid brass material inside.\r\n</p>",
